D7 native drag regression correction (2026-09-09)

Historical independent browser RED retained by reference:
  five-browser D7 run: 11 failed.
  Failure family: treating a raw source-element dragend as authoritative session completion caused the target transaction to be skipped, producing browser-level DnD failures.
  This historical count is retained as the stronger independent RED; the corrected unit contract must not assume adapter onDrop is absent in a real native drag sequence.

Correction in d7-dnd-resource.test.ts:
- Raw source-element dragend is dispatched before the target drop but must not preempt it.
- Target completes exactly one source/target transaction.
- Adapter source onDrop then closes the session.
- A second late target drop produces zero additional updates.

